{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55937","headline":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 九十四 · 居遁","name":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 九十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天真元具足，修证转差回。\n弃本却逐末，只守一场獃。\n（以上九十五首，均见《卍续藏经》本宋释子昇、如佑编《禅门诸祖师偈颂》卷上之上。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"居遁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55937.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55937","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}